{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は夕方からレッスンでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃ動いたよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや〜太ももとふくらはぎが鍛えられた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日々完成度があがっておる踊り大好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいねっヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んでレッスンの時間までかずみさんとお買い物に行きました〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"原宿と新宿いった!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみさんがカボチャのクレープ食べてた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これが噂のカボチャーズねっと思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまはバナナチョコクリームでし!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちとクリーム多かったじゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと宇宙柄のいろいろ探しましたヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宇宙を感じているね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと新宿。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまはね、もう新宿歩けるんだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日何回も『いや〜いこま成長したわ〜』と自分に言い聞かせていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カバン買ったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シンプルでカッコいいよ！今度のせますね!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと帽子も買ったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つの生えてるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これも今度のせますね!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この様にいこまちゃんはだんだん東京に慣れてきて、おしゃれを覚えてなんだろうね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまもそのうち乃木坂のお姉ちゃんになるのかな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもみんなきれいだからな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまが二十歳になったらどうなってんだろう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このままおっきくなってるのかな〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここでおにぎりのせるよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/13/5573517/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我が家のおにぎりはでかいんだよ！食べごたえありまくりっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ!!"}],"source":"archive"}